                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Proclamation Board No.</hi> 3,</head>
                <p>The Christian and other evil religions are strictly prohibited. Any person
                    suspected of violating this commandment must be reported to the proper officers,
                    and the reporter shall be rewarded.</p>
                <p>The 3d month of the 4th year of Ke Wo, (April, 1868.)</p>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Government Office.</hi></p>
            </div>
